// 4. Dead immunity `never-immune` (`Holds when False`).
Fact party Identified by Alice, Bob.
Fact vip Identified by party.

Fact eligible Identified by party
  Default d_base Holds When True
  Exception e_no Overrides d_base Rejects When party == Bob
  Exception e_vip Overrides d_base Holds When vip(party).

Power dead-grant Actor party Recipient party'
  Holds when True
  Valid when False
  Creates eligible(party').

Fact never-derived Identified by party
  Holds when False.

Immunity never-immune Holder party Against dead-grant
  Holds when False.
